# Runtime profile artifacts. The login session (cookies, localStorage,
# IndexedDB) lives in <userData>/Partitions/whatsapp on the machine that ran
# the app - never in this repository. These entries make sure a redirected
# or copied-in profile can never be committed by accident.
Partitions/
Cache/
GPUCache/
window-state.json
logs/*.jsonl
notifications.jsonl
